cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this firmware, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "umsf-ble-firmware: ESP32 firmware for dataset acquisition assemblies and merging nodes into a Bluetooth channel"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  ESP32 firmware (personnel node, stationary building-state node, BLE gateway) for the UMSF
  evidence-aware multisensor monitoring pilot. Portable C/C++ libraries implement the shared
  protocol v1.0 framing, fragmentation, RAM buffering with application acknowledgement,
  feature extraction and uncalibrated local detectors, and are host unit-tested. The ESP32
  firmware images are uncompiled and untested on hardware in this release. Not a certified
  safety or medical device.
keywords:
  - ESP32
  - Bluetooth Low Energy
  - NimBLE
  - MQTT
  - firmware
  - physiological monitoring
  - critical infrastructure
  - incident support
  - dataset acquisition
